msgstr "Enable payment iframe"


msgctxt "Languages::cardlink.enable_iframe_tip"
msgid "Customers will stay in website to complete payments without redirecting to Cardlink's eCommerce payment page.<br />You must have a valid SSL certificate installed on your domain.<br />Not recommended bacause some functionality will be unavailable. For example, the customer won’t be able to subscribe for newsletters at checkout."
msgstr "Customers will stay in website to complete payments without redirecting to Cardlink's eCommerce payment page.<br />You must have a valid SSL certificate installed on your domain."

